# macOS noise
.DS_Store
# iCloud conflict copies: syncing appends " 2", " 3", ... to the name. Numbering
# starts at 2, so " 1" is left alone — a legitimately named "Part 1.md" should
# not be silently ignored. No tracked file in this repo contains a space at all.
* [2-9]
* [2-9].*

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc

